# Working notes — never public.
# Convention: only README and CHANGELOG live at the repo root. Every other
# root-level .md is a working note and is auto-excluded, so a note dropped at
# the root can't leak. Public documentation goes under docs/ instead.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
*.rvt
*.rte
*.rfa
*.ifc
*.ifczip
*.jsonl
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
TestData/
backups/
*token*.txt
*.pfx
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
docs/internal/

# Generated / working files
mcp-manifest.json
docs/DOWNSTREAM_CONTRACTS.md

# Cross-repo handoffs are internal coordination — root-level, never public.
/handoffs/
docs/handoffs/
docs/HANDOFF.md

# Stray tool/simulation logs - never part of the repo.
*.log
